{{Headline|25|In Other News}}


Since so many of you kept misclicking, we've made it so you can't move to the tile behind the bank of the Mount Quidamortem.

Xeric's talisman will no longer notify you if it has lost over 50 charges.

The shortcut used to access the Trollheim herb patch now has sound effects when climbing.

The apothecary now correctly takes Coins when making Antipoison potions.

This week saw the arrival of [https://twitter.com/JagexBruno Mod Bruno] (Junior QA Analyst) and [https://twitter.com/JagexMunro Mod Munro] (Junior Content Developer). Follow them on Twitter, along with our other new arrival, [https://twitter.com/JagexLenny Mod Lenny]!

